{"asset_key":"ep2/env_story_12303700","episode":"ep2","category":"env_story","story_id":"12303700","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1230370001:1":{"text":"忘れたの？あたしはソニアさんに会うために、毎日ここに来てるのよ。","source_cn":"你忘了？人家可是为了索尼娅才每天守在这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05480F0A771BE36A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1230370002:1":{"text":"あたしは、ソニアさんに心から憧れているの！","source_cn":"索尼娅是人家的偶像！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1364E0B46792E2D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1230370003:1":{"text":"いつかあたしも、彼女みたいなかっこよくて勇ましい女性になりたいなぁ！","source_cn":"我希望像他一样帅气又有魄力！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0296CE4A4BF0C12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1230370004:1":{"text":"でも、ただ毎日ここで待ってるだけじゃダメよね。","source_cn":"但是，每天在这里守着可追不上她的步伐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF0028FA37F575E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1230370005:1":{"text":"そろそろ他の商売をやってみるべきかしら……","source_cn":"也许，是时候转行了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x209317198C903AC3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers